# Spark IDE - proven ide open bind (-> opened) + print op JSON.
# After key-open-nopath 4b7f791. Like run/new/buffer binds, open
# bind stores op JSON; print opened shows that JSON.
# Run: ./spark --dry-run examples/ide_open_bind.spark
# No Electron. No keymap n. No new asm - documents proven bind only.

ide open "examples/hello.spark" -> opened

print opened
